WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:04,520
Sister Xu Ya, do you want one for each of us?

2
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,520
Whoever is with me, whoever contributes, will be used

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:09,520
After being exposed to the sun for so long on the island, the mask is really useful

4
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:12,520
It’s normal to enjoy it, but don’t forget, the facial mask is not water or food

5
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:15,520
But you know in your mind whether you want to use it or not.

6
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:20,700
Her fire spring has just been weakened, and now she is changing her facial mask to continue to gain popularity

7
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,700
Resources are rights

8
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:24,700
You can see clearly, that's why I found a way out early

9
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:31,660
She has a cold and it's contagious

10
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:32,660
Who takes care of her, don't rely on my fire

11
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,660
She has been burned like this, do you still have any humanity left?

12
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,660
I just want to live. The whole camp is sick. Who can find food?

13
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:41,690
The fever is too severe, I can't just rest

14
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:45,720
Forget it, I'll go farther away so I don't drag you down.

15
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:48,480
follow me
